ers. This is Unit 5, Making a Piece: Steps and Process.","ar":"أهلاً بكم في الإنجليزية لمصمّمي الأثاث. هذه الوحدة الخامسة، صناعة القطعة: الخطوات والعمليّة."},"id":"L001"},{"actor":"layla","start":9.104,"text":{"en":"This is Part 3, How a Sofa Is Made. You will hear six stages, and meet Not Given again.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثالث، كيف تُصنع الكنبة. ستسمع ستّ مراحل، وتلتقي «غير مذكور» مرّة أخرى."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"layla","start":17.35,"text":{"en":"How many steps do you think there are in making a sofa?","ar":"كم خطوة تظنّ أنّ في صنع الكنبة؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"layla","start":21.708,"text":{"en":"Let me explain how a sofa is made.","ar":"دعني أشرح كيف تُصنع الكنبة."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"layla","start":25.394,"text":{"en":"First, the design is drawn in the office.","ar":"أوّلاً، يُرسم التصميم في المكتب."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"layla","start":29.464,"text":{"en":"Then the wood is cut and sanded in the workshop.","ar":"ثمّ يُقطع الخشب ويُصنفر في الورشة."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"layla","start":33.534,"text":{"en":"Next, the frame is assembled and checked.","ar":"بعد ذلك، يُجمَّع الهيكل ويُفحص."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"layla","start":37.364,"text":{"en":"After that, the seat is upholstered with foam and fabric.","ar":"بعد ذلك، يُنجَّد المقعد بالإسفنج والقماش."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"layla","start":42.25,"text":{"en":"The sofa is then varnished and cleaned in the finishing department.","ar":"ثمّ تُورنش الكنبة وتُنظَّف في قسم التشطيب."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"layla","start":47.28,"text":{"en":"Finally, it is checked by quality control and delivered.","ar":"أخيراً، تُفحص من قِبل ضبط الجودة وتُسلَّم."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"layla","start":52.118,"text":{"en":"Every step is done with care.","ar":"كلّ خطوة تُنجز بعناية."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"layla","start":55.348,"text":{"en":"Three sentences. True, False, or Not Given?","ar":"ثلاث جمل. صحيح، خطأ، أم غير مذكور؟"},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"layla","start":60.786,"text":{"en":"The wood is cut in the office.","ar":"يُقطع الخشب في المكتب."},"subHold":7.381,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"layla","start":68.167,"text":{"en":"False. It is cut in the workshop.","ar":"خطأ. يُقطع في الورشة."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"layla","start":72.501,"text":{"en":"The seat is upholstered with foam and fabric.","ar":"يُنجَّد المقعد بالإسفنج والقماش."},"subHold":9.367,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"layla","start":81.868,"text":{"en":"True.","ar":"صحيح."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"layla","start":84.09,"text":{"en":"The sofa is delivered in one day.","ar":"تُسلَّم الكنبة في يوم واحد."},"subHold":8.133,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"layla","start":92.223,"text":{"en":"Not Given. I said it is delivered, but never said how soon.","ar":"غير مذكور. قلتُ إنّها تُسلَّم، لكنّي لم أقل متى."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"khaled","start":98.069,"text":{"en":"So Not Given again, like Unit 3.","ar":"إذاً «غير مذكور» مرّة أخرى، كالوحدة الثالثة."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"layla","start":101.707,"text":{"en":"Yes. The step is mentioned; the speed is not.","ar":"نعم. الخطوة مذكورة؛ والسرعة ليست كذلك."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"layla","start":106.905,"text":{"en":"Six stages, and every one of them in the passive.","ar":"ستّ مراحل، وكلّ واحدة منها بالمبنيّ للمجهول."},"id":"L021"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"5feddda67aece0d2","bytes":49824,"sha":"6e987c7654e405fb","address":"lines/5feddda67aece0d2.mp3"},{"key":"bc52ac03991d71c2","bytes":47376,"sha":"cb6add0707e44893","address":"lines/bc52ac03991d71c2.mp3"},{"key":"300b18bcfe720c8e","bytes":24048,"sha":"ea2dd842b4e1e9d9","address":"lines/300b18bcfe720c8e.mp3"},{"key":"458f1f576914c15b","bytes":20016,"sha":"4ff702257097f69e","address":"lines/458f1f576914c15b.mp3"},{"key":"19e2f6b7802b500c","bytes":22320,"sha":"10f7838e0628af6f","address":"lines/19e2f6b7802b500c.mp3"},{"key":"6bb24a9d085a6d47","bytes":22320,"sha":"69d35de25fff7f90","address":"line